WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.734 --> 00:00:17.493
Chuck: Do you think the ants know what we did with the magnifying glass?

2
00:00:17.494 --> 00:00:19.395
Dave: What do you mean?

3
00:00:19.396 --> 00:00:24.140
Chuck: Remember, we used the sun's rays to burn little ants─

4
00:00:24.141 --> 00:00:33.372
Dave: Be quiet! If they don't know, we don't want them to find out.

5
00:00:33.373 --> 00:00:35.893
Ant 1: Into the ground, humans!

6
00:00:35.894 --> 00:00:38.433
Dave: No way.

7
00:00:38.434 --> 00:00:41.544
Ant 2: We paid the mites a lot of money for you.

8
00:00:41.545 --> 00:00:44.552
Climb into the hole!

9
00:00:44.553 --> 00:00:53.227
Chuck: I won't take orders from an ant!

10
00:00:53.228 --> 00:00:55.873
Ant 3: You are too little to challenge us.

11
00:00:55.874 --> 00:00:57.939
Ant 2: You will do what we say!

12
00:00:57.940 --> 00:01:04.647
Chuck & Dave: Okay.

13
00:01:04.648 --> 00:01:08.156
Chuck: I think this hole leads to where the ants live.

14
00:01:08.157 --> 00:01:11.955
Dave: First the mites captured us, now the ants.

15
00:01:11.956 --> 00:01:15.439
It's not fun being a slave.

16
00:01:15.440 --> 00:01:18.125
Chuck: What if they never let us out?

17
00:01:18.126 --> 00:01:31.869
Dave: I don't want to think about it!

18
00:01:31.870 --> 00:01:34.485
Chuck: I can’t believe we’re trapped here.

19
00:01:34.486 --> 00:01:40.329
Chuck: It's because of Danny and Brad and that stupid toy gun.

20
00:01:40.330 --> 00:01:45.616
Dave: I never thought I would say this, but I hope Danny [n3@finds a way to rescue us.

21
00:01:45.617 --> 00:01:57.652
Chuck: Yeah. And if he does, I will be very happy.

22
00:01:57.653 --> 00:02:01.124
Official Ant: I see that the trading mission was successful.

23
00:02:01.125 --> 00:02:03.855
Ant 1: Yes, the mites were telling the truth.

24
00:02:03.856 --> 00:02:07.799
They captured two humans.

25
00:02:07.800 --> 00:02:11.121
Official Ant: These are the smallest humans I have ever seen.

26
00:02:11.122 --> 00:02:13.263
Official Ant: It is extraordinary.

27
00:02:13.264 --> 00:02:16.888
Ant 1: I hope the queen will be pleased.

28
00:02:16.889 --> 00:02:18.726
Chuck: Queen?

29
00:02:18.727 --> 00:02:21.462
Dave: What does the queen want with us?

30
00:02:21.463 --> 00:02:25.956
Official Ant: Yes, the queen will be very happy to have humans in her zoo.

31
00:02:25.957 --> 00:02:34.038
Chuck & Dave: Zoo! Oh no!

32
00:02:34.039 --> 00:02:36.564
Tina: So where are the bullies?

33
00:02:36.565 --> 00:02:38.273
Have you seen them?

34
00:02:38.274 --> 00:02:41.235
Brad: Yes, the mites captured them.

35
00:02:41.236 --> 00:02:45.879
Bello: That's terrible. We should go back inside and rescue them.

36
00:02:45.880 --> 00:02:47.787
Danny: We tried that already.

37
00:02:47.788 --> 00:02:51.007
The mites don't have them anymore.

38
00:02:51.008 --> 00:02:52.923
Bello: What happened to them?

39
00:02:52.924 --> 00:02:55.123
Brad: Now ants have them.

40
00:02:55.124 --> 00:03:03.414
Danny: Yeah. When we got inside the fort, we saw the mites sell [n3@the bullies to some ants─some big ants.

41
00:03:03.415 --> 00:03:06.624
Tina: How are we going to find these ants?

42
00:03:06.625 --> 00:03:09.271
Danny: Ants make tunnels under the ground.

43
00:03:09.272 --> 00:03:12.340
It will be impossible to find them.

44
00:03:12.341 --> 00:03:14.160
Bello: Not so, Danny.

45
00:03:14.161 --> 00:03:16.783
I’m sure there’s a way.

46
00:03:16.784 --> 00:03:20.764
Brad: Ants also make trails above ground.

47
00:03:20.765 --> 00:03:22.586
Tina: That’s right, Brad.

48
00:03:22.587 --> 00:03:25.364
If we can spot some other ants─

49
00:03:25.365 --> 00:03:28.820
Danny: We could follow them to their tunnels!

50
00:03:28.821 --> 00:03:30.612
Bello: Wonderful.

51
00:03:30.613 --> 00:03:37.859
Brad: Okay, everyone. Let’s start looking for ant trails.
